      "message": "BIP461: add test vectors and reference implementation\n\nAll vectors were tested against libsecp256k1, and\nall verification vectors were checked against OpenSSL.\nA check was also added to the `verify` specification\nto reject pubkeys with x or y coordinates greater than\nor equal to `p`.",
